  "prefLabel": "Per-A 102.12 Offer of proof",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Per-A 102.12 “Offer of proof” means a representation by a party, whether orally or in writing, as to the testimony a witness would give to the board under oath with respect to the particular facts if the witness were to testify live.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Per-A 100) #7377, eff 10-23-00",
